    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i dont mean like a 'symptom'. i mean like... philosophically. like if life is just constant struggle and pain, is there actually any reason we're forced to keep going? it feels like people just say 'it gets better' to avoid facing the fact that maybe it doesn't have to be this way.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
